e, you can add $$$1$$$ two times."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the fourth test case, you can subtract $$$4$$$ and add $$$1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the fifth test case, you can just subtract $$$6$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"1311A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1311/problem/A"}